flowchart LR
    Client[Browser / curl] -->|HTTP, Host mtgmods.local| Ingress[Minikube Nginx Ingress]
    Ingress -->|ClusterIP :80| Service[license-service Service]
    Service --> Pod1[License Service pod 1]
    Service --> Pod2[License Service pod 2]
    Pod1 -->|SQL| Postgres[(PostgreSQL 16)]
    Pod2 -->|SQL| Postgres
    Pod1 -->|cache| Redis[(Redis 7.4)]
    Pod2 -->|cache| Redis
    Postgres --> PVC[(PersistentVolumeClaim 1 GiB)]
    ConfigMap[ConfigMap] -. runtime config .-> Pod1
    ConfigMap -. runtime config .-> Pod2
    Secret[Secret] -. credentials .-> Pod1
    Secret -. credentials .-> Pod2
    InitJob[Database init Job] -->|create schema| Postgres
